      "textEvidence": {
        "text": "This monster has one optional, non-targeting FLIP Trigger Effect, including when revealed by battle. At activation its controller pays exactly 2000 LP, requiring more than 2000 LP available; on resolution it inflicts 1000 effect damage to the opponent. Declining pays nothing. The cost remains paid if the effect is negated or its source leaves the field. Paying the cost does not inflict damage. There is no once-per-turn limit, target, secondary effect or duration. A battle-destroyed source can still activate after damage calculation if its controller survives and can pay the cost at that time.",
